    <worksheet name='nav qs'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Sheet1 (Help Center Definition List)' name='federated.00jb9fo1y0vi0z1eya4u90u0d3ek' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.00jb9fo1y0vi0z1eya4u90u0d3ek'>
            <column caption='Navigation' datatype='integer' name='[Calculation_2027605017793331201]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='1' />
            </column>
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_2027605017793331201]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:Calculation_2027605017793331201:ok]' pivot='key' type='ordinal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style />
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-disallow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Shape' />
            <mark-sizing mark-sizing-setting='marks-scaling-off' />
            <encodings>
              <shape column='[federated.00jb9fo1y0vi0z1eya4u90u0d3ek].[sum:Calculation_2027605017793331201:ok]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip show-buttons='false'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>The goal of this tab is to give an overview of the Navigation side of the HC performance. The next step after checking this tab will be to see which flows and leaves have the highest impact on the navigation performance and take action on them by changing the structure of the Help Center flows.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='size' value='1.4612706899642944' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{D1968D63-2A4E-4DF0-91EC-0C7B4D204E8F}' />
    </worksheet>
    <worksheet name='over qs'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Sheet1 (Help Center Definition List)' name='federated.00jb9fo1y0vi0z1eya4u90u0d3ek' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.00jb9fo1y0vi0z1eya4u90u0d3ek'>
            <column caption='Overview' datatype='integer' name='[Calculation_2027605017790595072]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='1' />
            </column>
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_2027605017790595072]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:Calculation_2027605017790595072:ok]' pivot='key' type='ordinal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style />
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-disallow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Shape' />
            <mark-sizing mark-sizing-setting='marks-scaling-off' />
            <encodings>
              <shape column='[federated.00jb9fo1y0vi0z1eya4u90u0d3ek].[sum:Calculation_2027605017790595072:ok]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip show-buttons='false'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>The goal of this tab is to provide a high level view on the entity performance. It shows 4 metrics:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Feedback rating % - This is our target metric showing the amount of positive feedback ratings out of all feedback ratings received. If the user submits the feedback rating multiple times per the same leaf within one session then only the last rating is taken into account.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>% of resolution sessions represents if the customer got the resolution out of those cases when we can make an unambiguous conclusion about the outcome. We can be sure about the outcome for the cases with positive/negative feedback or in case the customer was sent to an agent (those sessions are called sessions with an outcome). Out of those we can say that the customer got the resolution in case of positive feedback or contact initiation. The ratio of these numbers  represents how often the customer gets the resolution out of sessions when we are sure about the outcome. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>HC CSAT and Deflection rate are not leaf based metrics but provide a good overview on the holistic performance of the Help Center. Hence the only country filters can be applied to these charts.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Trend of these 4 metrics can give a flavour of the HC performance.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='size' value='1.4392818212509155' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{36BBD85E-C38B-4E60-A3B8-244F5BE44BB0}' />
    </worksheet>
  </worksheets>
